# `src/` — Reusable project library

## Authority

The root [`README.md`](../README.md) contract defines this layer. Package-specific
agent constraints are in [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md).

Use `src/{{ package_name }}/` for reusable, typed, tested behavior. Analysis
kernels transform in-memory values and remain pure. Explicit boundary adapters
such as `catalog.py` and `settings.py` may perform bounded reads when called; they
must not perform import-time I/O, orchestrate analysis stages, choose undeclared
output locations, or hide writes.

Snakemake DAG wiring and file-writing adapters belong in `workflow/`. Deliberate
operator CLIs belong in top-level `scripts/`. Disposable trials belong in
`exploratory/` until promoted into tested library code.
